/*
 * PlantProcess IQ canonical-journey professionalization layer.
 * This layer deliberately improves the full customer journey without replacing
 * page-specific ownership. It standardizes hierarchy, spacing, tables, forms,
 * fold/unfold behavior, icons, focus states and responsive containment.
